Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 15:57:29 +0700
Subject: [PATCH 11/11] feat(attachments): reading view for markdown documents

Markdown attachments open in a reader with a reading-progress bar and, for
documents with three or more headings, an outline beside the text on wide
screens (click to jump, current section highlighted).

Patch-Id: artifact-reader
